clinical_name,patient_id_public
# Cases where the Name column of GBM_clinical_data.xlsx is spelled differently from the
# imaging cohort folder name. Two fields per row: clinical spelling, de-identified ID. For example:/n# <ClinicalSpelling>,Pxxx
# This file contains spelling variants plus IDs only, no names, so it may be published with the
# repository; the default is empty.
